  "INTRODUCTION": ["heading", "framing"],
  "Defendant Halvorsen Logistics, Inc. (“Halvorsen”) respectfully submits this memorandum in support of its motion to dismiss the Complaint of Plaintiff Corvina Foods, LLC (“Corvina”) under Fed. R. Civ. P. 12(b)(6) and 9(b).": [
